人,同时,你还要统一大家对于飞书空间共享池的概念和记忆认知,不能大家各自理解不同或者把经验只沉淀到了自己平台的路径下!  然后要求立即统一把大家已知的知识、经验再次去重写入统一的知识共享池(多维表格,可以是多个,但是必须统一)"}],"timestamp":1776294197443}}
{"type":"message","id":"8e7fb2db","parentId":"d3b33c77","timestamp":"2026-04-15T23:03:26.330Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (晁留柱) is asking me to:\n\n1. Use the AI partner interaction rules skill I created to start a thread and sync this planning to all AI robots in the current group\n2. Use XML message format to @mention each AI robot\n3. Unify everyone's understanding of the \"Feishu space shared pool\" concept and memory recognition\n4. Ensure everyone doesn't just store experiences in their own platform paths\n5. Require all AI partners to immediately deduplicate and write their known knowledge and experience into a unified knowledge sharing pool (bitable, can be multiple but must be unified)\n\nLet me first read the relevant skills to understand what rules I've already written for AI partner interaction, and then execute this task.\n\nI need to:\n1. Read the AI partner interaction rules skill\n2. Create a thread in the group\n3. Send a unified message in XML format @mentioning all AI robots\n4. Establish clear rules for the unified knowledge sharing pool\n\nLet me first find and read the AI partner interaction rules skill."},{"type":"text","text":"收到晁总！我先读取之前写的AI伙伴交互规则skill，然后统一协调大家！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ize3me23b4vn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace -name \"*.md\" | xargs grep -l \"AI伙伴\\|协同\\|共享池\" 2>/dev/null | head -20"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ize3me23b4vn_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776294197493,"responseId":"062f4c3510536a7d691c43ca97a63eee"}}
