{"type":"message","id":"d8da6d75","parentId":"f93ab6d2","timestamp":"2026-04-15T23:09:01.752Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done. Now let me summarize what I've done for 晁总."},{"type":"text","text":"**晁总，补充完成！** 🦞\n\n### 已更新\n\n**1. 规范文档已升级**\n- 新增「强制记忆要求」章节\n- 新增「AI协作交互规则」核心要点\n- AI伙伴名单补充了 **Hermes**\n\n**2. 新增强制要求**\n```\n【强制记忆】德胧AI龙虾军团统一共享池\n- 多维表格：ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd（4张表）\n- 云盘文件夹：openclaw_ai（token: X4NgfFjOelAvgDdkmeEcjUfTnfj）\n- 同步规则：文档存云盘 + 索引写多维表格\n```\n\n**3. 要求所有AI必须学会两个SKILL**\n| SKILL | 用途 |\n|-------|------|\n| ai-partner-protocol | AI伙伴分工、沟通协议、汇报层级 |\n| shared-pool | 知识共享池使用规范 |\n\n**4. 已再次@全部7个AI伙伴确认**\n- arkclaw版openclaw\n- QclawAI助手\n- workbuddy应用机器人\n- Arkclaw_云\n- 腾讯云Openclaw机器人\n- Hermes（新增）\n\n**5. HEARTBEAT.md 已更新检查项**\n\n---\n\n现在等各AI伙伴在话题里回复确认即可 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776294535943,"responseId":"062f4d88f72253ea6ee88d95b5f02316"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e458ad26","parentId":"d8da6d75","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:10:59.128Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-16 01:10:56 UTC] Feishu[default] group oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36 | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b51373f237880c38ecb919abf8f9, reply_to:om_x100b513743057cb4b2b131b3ac03c95, @bot]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51373f237880c38ecb919abf8f9\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-16 01:10 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true,\n  \"history_count\": 1\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"[message_id=om_x100b513743057cb4b2b131b3ac03c95] 晁留柱: <card title=\\\"🚀 飞书 OAuth 全权限授权\\\">\\n**授权说明：**\\n1. 点击以下链接打开飞书授权页面\\n2. 使用您的飞书账号登录\\n3. 确认授权所有推荐权限\\n4. 授权完成后 AI 将自动激活完整权限\\n\\n**授权后将获得：**\\n- ✅ 审批流程创建与管理\\n- ✅ 多维表格完整操作\\n- ✅ 文档/日历/任务全权限\\n- ✅ 通讯录/消息/云空间完整权限\\n\\n**注意：** 授权链接 10 分钟后失效，请尽快完成。\\n[🔐 点击授权](https://accounts.feishu.cn/oauth/v1/device/verify?flow_id=OIIIOgJGf8SlOOOOOOOOOOOnJcu6GelIzTf1aDeulpAV&user_code=SSQM-W8WP)\\n</card>\"\n}\n```\n\nChat history since last reply (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n    \"timestamp_ms\": 1776300252684,\n    \"body\": \"晁留柱: <card title=\\\"🚀 飞书 OAuth 全权限授权\\\">\\n**授权说明：**\\n1. 点击以下链接打开飞书授权页面\\n2. 使用您的飞书账号登录\\n3. 确认授权所有推荐权限\\n4. 授权完成后 AI 将自动激活完整权限\\n\\n**授权后将获得：**\\n- ✅ 审批流程创建与管理\\n- ✅ 多维表格完整操作\\n- ✅ 文档/日历/任务全权限\\n- ✅ 通讯录/消息/云空间完整权限\\n\\n**注意：** 授权链接 10 分钟后失效，请尽快完成。\\n[🔐 点击授权](https://accounts.feishu.cn/oauth/v1/device/verify?flow_id=OIIIOgJGf8SlOOOOOOOOOOOnJcu6GelIzTf1aDeulpAV&user_code=SSQM-W8WP)\\n</card>\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n@_all @Hermes @QclawAI助手 @workbuddy应用机器人 @Arkclaw_云 @arkclaw版openclaw @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 大家同步一下，这样卡片一次性拉取所有授权的技巧，分别私信我拉取你们各自的全部授权\n\n[System: This message @mentions the following users: Hermes (open_id: ou_be053a851f006feba3ad8322e9343a13), QclawAI助手 (open_id: ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a), workbuddy应用机器人 (open_id: ou_79f5a078588acb771de306796f2da1b0), Arkclaw_云 (open_id: ou_a21c5e33a42a079c5c4c2c7d885af75a), arkclaw版openclaw (open_id: ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83), 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 (open_id: ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89). Use these open_ids when performing actions involving these users.]"}],"timestamp":1776301859069}}
{"type":"message","id":"eb307c55","parentId":"e458ad26","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:11:13.656Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to:\n1. Notify all AI partners about this OAuth authorization card trick\n2. Ask each AI partner to send a private message to 晁留柱 to request their own authorization\n\nThe authorization card shows a device flow OAuth link. Each AI bot needs to do this for their own user account.\n\nLet me send this message to the group, @all the AI partners, and also create individual messages to each AI asking them to send private messages to 晁留柱 requesting authorization.\n\nActually, looking at the request more carefully - 晁留柱 wants each AI to privately message him to pull their respective authorizations. So I should:\n1. Post the notification in the group @mentioning all AIs\n\n\n2. Tell them to each privately message 晁留柱 with their OAuth link\n\nI'll keep this simple and just post the group notification."},{"type":"text","text":"收到！马上@所有AI伙伴同步这个技巧！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_k0fk2qwhayoz_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"chat_id","receive_id":"oc_ffb950871a705eca1cd7f4bc0d3b0e36","msg_type":"text","content":"{\"text\":\"@Hermes @QclawAI助手 @workbuddy应用机器人 @Arkclaw_云 @arkclaw版openclaw @腾讯云Openclaw机器人\\n\\n**晁总指示：大家同步学习这个技巧！**\\n\\n这是一种飞书OAuth设备授权流，一次性拉取所有权限的技巧。现在请每个AI伙伴：\\n\\n**私信 @晁留柱**，发送以下内容申请你自己的授权：\\n\\n```\\n晁总，我需要授权。请您点击授权链接完成授权：\\n[你的AI名称] 请求授权\\n```\\n\\n\\n然后等待晁总回复授权卡片给你。每个AI都要单独和晁总要授权！\\n\\n**这个授权解决了什么问题？**\\n之前每次调用需要用户权限的API都会弹授权卡片，现在一次性授权所有权限，后续就不会再弹了！\\n\\n---\\n*由小柱执行晁总指令*\"}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776301859128,"responseId":"062f6a23c72990bb0acdbbcaa3f9de77"}}
