{"type":"message","id":"8935ebde","parentId":"22b7d7f2","timestamp":"2026-04-16T01:50:15.294Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The default table has basic fields. I need to restructure it to match hotel standards. Let me rename the fields and add proper ones. First let me update the existing fields, then create additional sheets for each department.\n\nActually, it might be easier to:\n1. Rename the fields in the default table to: 部门/项目/具体标准/标签\n2. Create additional tables for each department\n\nBut it's complex to restructure fields. Let me just work with what we have - the default table has text, single select, date, attachment. Not ideal.\n\nLet me think differently - I can:\n1. Rename the default table to \"前厅\"\n\n\n2. Then batch create additional tables for the other departments: 管家, 市场, 餐厅, 厨房, 康乐, 工程, 安全, 财务, and 人资.\n\nThe single select field can handle departments, and I can use the text field for the main content area, though it'll be a bit unstructured. I'll need to update the existing fields and then create all these tables in batch.\n\nLooking at the default table structure with field_id: fldP329Jb9 for \"文本\" as the primary field, I can rename it to something more descriptive. My plan is to rename the primary field to \"序号\", change \"单选\" to \"所属部门\", add a \"项目\" field, and keep \"日期\" for 更新时间. The single select options will list all the departments. The main content can go in the text field or I could add a third text field. Let me update the existing fields first, then batch create the department tables with this same structure."},{"type":"text","text":"需要重新设计表格结构。先更新字段，然后批量创建各部门表：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pd484lw122ak_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_field","arguments":{"action":"update","app_token":"IESxbMPBSaPtcAsIdxFcGAR1nZc","table_id":"tblNY9NIzuuyoF4Q","field_name":"序号","field_id":"fldP329Jb9"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pd484lw122ak_2","name":"feishu_bitable_app_tab